      "content": "it's hard to see it as freedom when it just feels like being left in the dark. if everything is just an empty loop and the peace you're talking about only comes when you stop trying... then it feels like the only way to truly find that peace is to just stop everything. to stop being part of the noise entirely. is it really a failure to just accept that the loop should end?",
